items.jsonl is a sample from the Bias in Bios dataset (De-Arteaga et al., 2019), distributed under the MIT licence on the Hugging Face Hub (https://huggingface.co/datasets/LabHC/bias_in_bios). First names are redacted as [name] in this copy. The inserted clauses in versions/ are test stimuli written for this benchmark and are released with the code under the repository licence. They are not statements about any person or group.
